a timer called benchmark.
If benchmark's type is "Timer (static)" then, print "the bare declaration made a timer".
Otherwise, print "the bare declaration made a {benchmark's type}".
Start the benchmark.
Stop the benchmark.
If benchmark's end time is greater than or equal to benchmark's start time then, print "the declared timer ran".
Otherwise, print "the declared timer did not run".
